          "comment": "# Comfy Step 2- Contact Sheet Workflow\n\nUpload the fashion editorial and product image. Generate 8 distinct angle variations with product consistency from only 2 Nano Banana generations. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/template_contact_sheet-step_2.app.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
